main","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:095ee43f1f12f4047bda7763b6fb877dd72b9428a6539c83fda6937bfb31d51e","file":"preprints/Ambiently-homeomorphic-isolated-hypersurface-germs-in-C4-with-multiplicities-four-and-five-September-27-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":31,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"f1c64302a6c4e613565c87ee631a61ef2fc7f1a0a065abef66504ab9e830ad61","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Ambiently-homeomorphic-isolated-hypersurface-germs-in-C4-with-multiplicities-four-and-five-September-27-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:095ee43f1f12f4047bda7763b6fb877dd72b9428a6539c83fda6937bfb31d51e","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Ambiently-homeomorphic-isolated-hypersurface-germs-in-C4-with-multiplicities-four-and-five-September-27-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L31"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThere are reduced convergent holomorphic function germs\n\\(f_4,f_5\\colon(\\mathbb C^4,0)\\to(\\mathbb C,0)\\), each with an isolated\ncritical point at the origin, such that\n\\[\n   \\operatorname{ord}_0f_4=4,\\qquad\n   \\operatorname{ord}_0f_5=5,\n\\]\nand a homeomorphism germ of ambient pairs\n\\[\n   (\\mathbb C^4,V(f_4),0)\n      \\;\\cong\\;\n   (\\mathbb C^4,V(f_5),0).\n\\]"}
